[ti:ॐ हिरण्यगर्भः समवर्तताग्रे II]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]ॐ हिरण्यगर्भः समवर्तताग्रे
[00:12.03]भूतस्य जातः पतिरेक आसीत्
[00:16.07]Om hiraṇyagarbhaḥ samavartatāgre
[00:20.10]bhūtasya jātaḥ patireka āsīt
[00:24.13]Before the stars and before the sky,
[00:28.16]A golden egg in silence lie.
[00:32.20]No darkness there, no beam of light,
[00:36.23]Just cosmic breath in endless night.
[00:40.26]Sabse pahle Hiranyagarbha, golden womb divine,
[00:44.29]Shunya ke andar dhadakta tha the seed of space-time.
[00:48.33]Anda phoota — Bhumi neeche, Dyaus upar udaya,
[00:52.36]Rigveda ke mantra se brahmand jagmagaya.
[00:56.39]Akshar bane agni jaise, dhvani bani praan,
[01:00.42]ऋषियों के ध्यान से जन्मा सारा विज्ञान।
[01:04.46]Phir Pangu jaaga chaos ke ande ke beech,
[01:08.49]Dàdàn phat gaya jab usne liya stretch.
[01:12.52]Tiān aur Dì ko alag karta, khada raha yugon tak,
[01:16.56]Atharah hazaar saal tak dhakka deta akash tak.
[01:20.59]Fēng bani saans uski, Yun bane badal,
[01:24.62]Sharir se bane pahaad aur dariya nirmal.
[01:28.65]Door uttar mein Kalevala ki kahani boli,
[01:32.69]Ek hans udi samundar par akeli aur bhooli।
[01:36.72]Saat ande Kulta ke toot gaye lehron mein,
[01:40.75]Suraj nikla tukdon se sitaron ke shehron mein।
[01:44.78]Chand bana ek tukda, samay bana dhaar,
[01:48.82]Din-mahine-saal sab jag gaye ek baar।
[01:52.85]Orphic egg se nikla Phanes, jyoti ka dev,
[01:56.88]Golden wings wale praan se jag hua sev।
[02:00.91]Chaos se cosmos bana, jyoti bani pran,
[02:04.95]Greek bhi jaante the anda ka gyaan।
[02:08.98]Nile ki ret pe ek cosmic egg pada,
[02:13.01]Ra nikla usme se, surya ban khada।
[02:17.05]Lotus se utha prakash ka saar,
[02:21.08]Ande mein chhupa tha poora sansar।
[02:25.11]Par phir aaya ek yug ajeeb sa bhai,
[02:29.14]Humpty Dumpty deewar pe chadh gaya bhai।
[02:33.18]Gir gaya clock ke chakra mein ek din,
[02:37.21]Aur toot gaya anda — kho gaya origin।
[02:41.24]King ke log gin rahe seconds aur saal,
[02:45.27]Par kho gaya cosmic anda ka khayal।
[02:49.31]Hum tukde nahi, hum brahmand hain,
[02:53.34]Purusha ke andar sab praan hain।
[02:57.37]Wǒmen shì yī gè (We are one) — ek hi praan,
[03:01.40]Sabhi sabhyataon ka ek hi gyaan।
[03:05.44]Aika (Time) ke chakra mein mat kho jaana,
[03:09.47]Ande ke andar ka satya pehchana।
[03:13.50]Rigveda bole — anda hi brahmand ka beej,
[03:17.54]China bole — Pangu hai uska seed.
[03:21.57]Finland bole — hans ne diya prakash,
[03:25.60]Egypt bole — anda mein chhupa surya ka vikas।
[03:29.63]Greek bole — Phanes jyoti ka swar,
[03:33.67]Aur Bharat bole — Purusha hi sansar।
[03:37.70]Hemant bole duniya ke beech khada,
[03:41.73]Sabhi sabhyataon ka ek hi anda।
[03:45.76]Break the shell, see the light,
[03:49.80]You are the cosmos in the night.
[03:53.83]Anda nahi kahani hai,
[03:57.86]Ye hi sabse purani hai।
[04:01.89]Jab tak tu khud ko samjhega nahi,
[04:05.93]Tab tak brahmand khुलेगा नहीं।
